  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Boiling point is directly proportional to intermolecular Forces. Since Fluorine is highly electronegative element it forms hydrogen bonding. Because of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>-</mo></math> bonding <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math> has high boiling point.<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/16797b83-57bd-41fd-b6f4-25bf3c04cd6a-image4.png\" /></p>",
